        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kibelokinos, kisimoromoroto ekakiror, kinyakutu ŋinituŋanan ekebulesit ka ninirunanan akebulesit, luipotu koosikinito kwape ekototor; kitubulesenoto bobo, araut kamakus ibulesin ka abulesin, ",
