        {
          "text": " Ŋes enerar EJAKAIT kwanata ebe: Mam ipotu kiirasi eoŋ, alimor aosianakin, ŋinituŋanan onaceke, ka nininnjanan aupake, Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Koany, alimori aosianakin kama ejai ekileŋ, ka atular, ka eteŋei; ido kainakini yes aisiarisiario roma ajakanuto kere nuka akwap, ",
